enever reset. It matters what it looks like on a regular Monday afternoon or a regular Tuesday morning. You've not done anything special. That is the real test. It's going to give you so much data, so much information. It's going to let you know whether your house is running smoothly, if it's running organised, what energy do you really have, what time do you really have without you having to have these pockets of bursts of like mad energy to do a reset. Because we can all do that and it looks great for 30 minutes afterwards, but is it sustainable?", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Contrarian", "videoViewCount": null}, {"shortCode": "Db6Bu2JtWdt", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Db6Bu2JtWdt/", "caption": "Staying ahead of the house is NOT about spotless rooms. It\u2019s about doing the small things before they become big things. A made bed, dishes done, a quick wash on. Tiny jobs that stop the build-up. The mess will come back (of course it will) but you\u2019re never quite starting from scratch \u2764\ufe0f\ud83e\ude77", "timestamp": "2026-08-11T16:34:20.000Z", "videoDuration": 5.803537, "videoPlayCount": 45585, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 1, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/772632294_18452446492142472_4580817977909185669_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=102&ig_cache_key=Mzk2MTQ4NjQzOTUxMzE1NTQzNzE4NDUyNDQ2NDg2MTQyNDcy.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=52UVRPp2XyMQ7kNvwFdpQu4&_nc_oc=AdrHTXwhtaSq_Kl4nQs-pHeeLY_jDKEOnlugNOfL3gGkfU8WdZTaFdAzpoghNJkCNVo&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=DxEM5Fxa6PLjIeeH4V4ANw&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQLjTr5pZUYGmvJ9Vx22OxWsj3bbTcALo18TnT8gv08-Iw&oe=6A9A2C18", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-mad1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQPFGBTAhV7M7puVZ9izi_nl4c97NFxnFIr4WULZbJZwKqaDhBClN6_ws8C868wP-_tpJqLcFiAJ9rzky2jlTSM-H3pxMbuCR9