nd this is why it is crucial, more than ever, to work within the time and the energy and the lifestyle that you have. Anything other than that is always going to leave you feeling like you could be doing more. It's not sustainable, and it is going to burn you out. So what does that look like practically? So the first thing is to work out, realistically, how much time and energy you have on a weekly basis. Start there. It might not be a lot, but that is all that you have, right? So work with that. Then work out the stuff that needs cleaning regularly, and then divide the time and the energy that you know you have by those rooms. That's where you start. And slowly build on it if you can and if you want to.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Problem"}, {"shortCode": "Dbkoq8gtA31", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/Dbkoq8gtA31/", "caption": "You can\u2019t argue with maths! (Even if it is the housework kind)", "timestamp": "2026-08-03T09:11:44.000Z", "videoDuration": 19.71229, "videoPlayCount": 17754, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 187, "commentsCount": 7, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/763122457_18450977155142472_2292472314908015088_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=Mzk1NTQ2NTI0NTc4OTc4NTU4OTE4NDUwOTc3MTQ5MTQyNDcy.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fZGVmYXVsdF9jb3Zlcl9mcmFtZS5DMyJ9&_nc_ohc=dw90JriAGaQQ7kNvwGfDuHp&_nc_oc=Adprm3qo1bV4pZR9CAhBEC01nv9_B3otolj39zh0crQLpEjH9YAob5pxJNwShFlDDzY&_nc_ad=z-m&_nc_cid=0&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=kRigW4eHN3oRbnerDlTKfQ&_nc_ss=7a22e&oh=00_AQJwr-Ri1q1Lqb0G6DQVj7L4Yi6y_7LYudSjTVt6sGOtig&oe=6A9A1AE2", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQN33xPVQjRSYKzXzejdvjxif9khehV4X_JWWFVGYyhLlGg8U6Kdm15KqoB8CCpna1erhWJJ_sHjCqIk_DNaVQ__FEs5DdS6WNUn7SM.mp4?_nc_cat=109&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-fco2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=rnyx-KVC0TgQ7kNvwFoN4TO&efg=eyJ2ZW5